## MonoGame.Steamworks

This is MonoGame.Steamworks.

It is based on FNA.Steamworks, which is a reimplementation of the Xbox Live features in XNA4.

Some changes

* Upgrade to the .net SDK Style projects.
* Switch to a .net 9 TargetFramework
* Depend on the Steamworks.NET NuGet
* Switch out FNA to MonoGame.

Project Website: https://github.com/infinitespace-studios/MonoGame.Steamworks

